This package is an independent implementation of the Propose-Probe-Compose approach that
RFC 004 calls "Google Harness²". It does not vendor or copy Google Research code: the RFC
names no upstream package to wrap. The canonical Google Research citation for Harness²
has not been supplied and must be added here before any release.
